            "question": "Can I pass fees onto my clients?",
            "answer": "Absolutely. \n\nSurcharging is natively supported, and you have granular control over which fees get passed along. For example, you might choose to pass on credit card fees to client but absorb the ACH fees yourself, tailoring the fee structure to fit your business model."
